=== Copihue Struct Demonstration ===

1. Declaration with type:
   p1 = (10, 20)
2. Struct literal:
   p2 = (30, 40)
3. Field access in expressions:
   sum = (40, 60)
4. Function with struct parameters:
   distance(p1, p2) = 40
5. Multiple struct types:
   rect(15x25) area = 375
6. Field modification:
   modified p1 = (15, 40)

=== All struct features working! ===
